Welcome to Quantum Star: Generations!

QS:Gen is a competitive browser-based space strategy and combat style game. No
downloads are required to play. Players aim to upgrade their fleets of mining
and war vessels, support their planets, and produce fighters all in order to
defeat enemy clans, and fractions, of other players.


Installation
------------

Whether you are updating an existing installation or creating a new one, refer
to the docs/install file for detailed instructions.


Special 0.7.1 -> 0.7.2 Upgrade Instructions
-------------------------------------------

If you have an existing 0.7.1 installation, you can upgrade to 0.7.2 and
continue playing any games in progress. If no games are in progres, it is
recommended that you perform a new installation (optionally preserving all
existing user accounts).

To upgrade 0.7.1 to 0.7.2:
1) Backup your existing 0.7.1 source and database
2) Un-tar 0.7.2 over the existing 0.7.1 source
3) Use phpMyAdmin (or mysql or whatever) to execute the commands in the
   install/sql/mysql/update_sql.sql file on your existing 0.7.1 database.

Note: The database changes in 0.7.2 include changes to the ship types. Thus all
      new ships will use these new types, but all existing ships will remain as
      they were in 0.7.1.


List of Changes
---------------

For a complete list of changes in each release of QS:Gen, see the
docs/CHANGELOG file.
